        },
        {
          "text": " “Atoning'o nanu imorot e Moab o esukeny oo le Amon, ina natusukenya ninche iltung'ana laainei nerup ate ti alo enkop enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 19.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neaku ore anaa enaishu nanu,” Olaitoriani loo lororani ojo, Enkai e Israel, “Ketiu Moab anaa Sodom, ore ile Amon netiu anaa Gomora, enkop oo suut o ngumot e munyan, neaku olmuate ntarasi. Ore ilo pisiai otelekua loo ltung'ana laainei neraya ninche, ore ilo pisiai otelekua lo losho lai neya ninche.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
